    "Ghidra raw-slice pseudocode cannot resolve outside jump-table memory; both actual four-way table entries and target instructions are separately bound and inspected.",
    "Generic HTTP/Read/stack-probe/clock/wait helpers stop at their required interfaces. No complete transport or platform fidelity claim.",
    "Synthetic instruction fixtures mock Read/stack probing; they do not execute the application, contact a service or establish updater operation/parity."
